  background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 45%, transparent);
  pointer-events: none;
  animation: click-ripple 620ms var(--ease-out) forwards;
  will-change: transform, opacity;
}
@keyframes click-ripple {
  from { transform: scale(0.35); opacity: 0.55; }
  to { transform: scale(7); opacity: 0; }
}
```

Scale 7 → 98px. Nice. But with `margin` and transform origin center. Fine. Add a second ring? User said ripple accent color. A filled soft circle is subtle. Maybe combine filled + 1px ring for M3 feel, but "без обводки" ambiguity... Use filled only.

